WEBVTT

01:37.910 --> 01:39.700
<b>What? Sakura, what's wrong?</b>

01:39.700 --> 01:41.740
<b>- Get the hell off me already!
- Got a stomachache?</b>

01:41.740 --> 01:44.750
<b>You've got some nerve to use me
as your damn horse!</b>

01:44.830 --> 01:47.000
<b>Morning, Kotoha-chan.</b>

01:47.120 --> 01:48.830
<b>Granny Sato!</b>

01:48.830 --> 01:50.130
<b>Get off already!</b>

01:50.130 --> 01:55.300
<b>You're telling me to get down from this height?
You're so inconsiderate of your elders.</b>

01:50.670 --> 01:55.300
<b>CAFÉ POTHOS</b>

01:55.550 --> 01:56.920
<b>I'll slap you down!</b>

01:56.920 --> 02:00.220
<b>Goodness, you really are inattentive. Hmph.</b>

02:01.600 --> 02:05.350
<b>Huh!? You said your hips hurt so bad
you couldn't even stand!</b>

02:05.350 --> 02:10.770
<b>Ow, Ow. My hips hurt so much,
I can barely walk.</b>

02:10.770 --> 02:13.110
<b>What hip!? You're totally fine, damn it!</b>

02:14.360 --> 02:19.070
<b>But when all is said and done,
you still are a Furin boy.</b>

02:19.780 --> 02:22.240
<b>Thanks. You're a lifesaver.</b>

02:24.540 --> 02:26.790
<b>Damn it, I'm outta here!</b>

02:26.790 --> 02:28.710
<b>Oh, Sakura! Hold on!</b>

02:28.710 --> 02:29.710
<b>Whaddya want?</b>

02:30.460 --> 02:35.250
<b>A fully packed egg sandwich
with seasonal fruits! Eat up!</b>

02:36.380 --> 02:38.800
<b>Today is your entrance ceremony at last!</b>

02:39.010 --> 02:41.840
<b>But wasn't it starting in the afternoon?</b>

02:42.140 --> 02:43.890
<b>It's only ten o'clock.</b>

02:48.180 --> 02:49.520
<b>Are you all pumped up?</b>

02:49.520 --> 02:51.730
<b>As if! I was just out on a walk!</b>

02:53.770 --> 02:56.900
<b>Well, maybe you can get a bit excited.</b>

02:58.860 --> 03:01.110
<b>There are a lot
of interesting guys over there.</b>

03:01.530 --> 03:03.570
<b>I-I told you, it's nothin' like that!</b>

03:03.570 --> 03:07.080
<b>Kotoha-san!</b>

03:13.250 --> 03:15.880
<b>Oh, if it isn't Nirei-chan. Morning.</b>

03:15.880 --> 03:18.340
<b>Morning, Granny Sato!</b>

03:20.670 --> 03:22.760
<b>How do I look, Kotoha-san?</b>

03:23.640 --> 03:26.510
<b>My new Furin uniform
looks spiffy on me, right?</b>

03:27.680 --> 03:29.680
<b>You still have the tag on your back.</b>

03:29.680 --> 03:32.390
<b>Huh? You're right!</b>

03:33.980 --> 03:37.190
<b>The heck? I can't get it off.</b>

03:38.780 --> 03:41.990
<b>Silly me, I forgot to take
the tag off my pants, too.</b>

03:43.450 --> 03:44.910
<b>Is this guy in Furin, too?</b>

03:44.910 --> 03:47.990
<b>That's right.
You two will be in the same grade.</b>

03:48.200 --> 03:52.410
<b>What do you mean, "this guy"?
I've never seen you around, either!</b>

03:52.500 --> 03:55.080
<b>Did you actually come from out of town!?</b>

03:55.250 --> 03:58.000
<b>I did. It don't matter
where I'm from, anyway.</b>

03:58.000 --> 04:00.340
<b>Besides, what's up with that?</b>

04:00.590 --> 04:02.380
<b>That hair, and those eyes!</b>

04:03.180 --> 04:04.340
<b>What about 'em?</b>

04:05.430 --> 04:09.140
<b>Stressed out? Must be rough,
even though you're so young.</b>

04:09.520 --> 04:13.140
<b>Huh? Stress? S-t-r-e-s-s?</b>

04:16.770 --> 04:17.270
<b>Hey!</b>

04:17.270 --> 04:18.690
<b>Sorry, my bad.</b>

04:18.690 --> 04:23.150
<b>Nirei, this is Sakura.
He came to this town yesterday.</b>

04:23.150 --> 04:25.410
<b>And, this is Nirei.</b>

04:26.990 --> 04:28.120
<b>Sakura.</b>

04:28.990 --> 04:32.250
<b>Never heard of any Sakura from outta town.</b>

04:32.450 --> 04:35.370
<b>Why did some nobody come to this town?</b>

04:32.450 --> 04:38.290
<b>TOP SECRET</b>

04:35.670 --> 04:38.290
<b>He means no harm. That's just how he is.</b>

04:38.790 --> 04:42.920
<b>Furin High isn't an ordinary school.
Did you know?</b>

04:43.510 --> 04:48.260
<b>Members of Bofurin stood up
to protect the locals.</b>

04:48.260 --> 04:52.180
<b>They defend the weak and crush the wicked.
They really are heroes of justice.</b>

04:52.430 --> 04:55.810
<b>Everyone coming to Furin
admire our upperclassmen,</b>

04:55.810 --> 04:58.650
<b>and they all want to help protect
the town as well.</b>

04:58.650 --> 05:00.690
<b>They're all super cool!</b>

05:00.860 --> 05:02.690
<b>And of course, I'm one of them!</b>

05:02.690 --> 05:08.820
<b>So why would a nobody with no ties
whatsoever to this town come to Furin?</b>

05:13.080 --> 05:14.710
<b>To take the top spot there.</b>

05:16.460 --> 05:20.920
<b>It really is awesome to be
a hero of justice protecting the town.</b>

05:21.670 --> 05:24.260
<b>Looks like there are plenty
of strong guys there.</b>

05:25.010 --> 05:30.220
<b>And I think I'd be satisfied
if I'm the best among them.</b>

05:33.180 --> 05:37.390
<b>You shouldn't say stuff you can never do.</b>

05:38.190 --> 05:39.730
<b>If you say that...</b>

05:40.400 --> 05:42.190
<b>If you strive for that...</b>

05:44.110 --> 05:45.740
<b>You'll go bald.</b>

05:48.780 --> 05:50.660
<b>All right, we're takin' this outside!</b>

05:50.660 --> 05:51.450
<b>Oh!</b>

05:51.450 --> 05:52.330
<b>What's up?</b>

05:52.330 --> 05:53.990
<b>It's already this late?</b>

05:54.200 --> 05:56.120
<b>Kotoha-san, I'll be going now!</b>

05:56.120 --> 05:59.250
<b>- Hey, hold up! Hey!
- Oh, you're not eating your usual breakfast?</b>

05:59.250 --> 06:01.840
<b>- I just came by today to show off my uniform.
- Listen to me!</b>

06:01.840 --> 06:05.260
<b>I thought I'd do three rounds of town patrol
before the entrance ceremony.</b>

06:07.220 --> 06:10.340
<b>Because starting today,
I'm a hero of justice, too!</b>

06:14.970 --> 06:16.020
<b>Ow!</b>

06:16.480 --> 06:18.140
<b>See? Isn't he a funny guy?</b>

06:18.140 --> 06:23.190
<b>Yeah, funny! I've never met a klutz like that
who won't listen to what others say!</b>

06:23.190 --> 06:27.610
<b>And what's with him! What a dork!
Guys like that are entering Furin, too?</b>

06:28.150 --> 06:31.280
<b>A hero of justice should be cooler than that.</b>

06:31.280 --> 06:35.330
<b>Oh? I never thought you'd talk about looks.</b>

06:35.490 --> 06:37.000
<b>Want more coffee?</b>

06:37.290 --> 06:38.790
<b>I'm not talking about clothes.</b>

06:39.750 --> 06:44.420
<b>Guys like that who are only about style
always chicken out in fights.</b>

06:44.420 --> 06:46.380
<b>Nothing is lamer than that.</b>

06:46.550 --> 06:49.300
<b>You sure make assumptions, huh?</b>

06:50.180 --> 06:53.180
<b>I've seen it a sickening number of times.</b>

06:54.850 --> 06:56.100
<b>I see.</b>

06:57.100 --> 06:58.060
<b>Hey, Sakura.</b>

06:58.560 --> 07:01.150
<b>Do you know what color a coffee fruit is?</b>

07:05.270 --> 07:08.780
<b>Brown. Coffee-colored?</b>

07:09.280 --> 07:10.570
<b>It's red.</b>

07:10.650 --> 07:13.160
<b>And it's smooth like a cherry.</b>

07:13.410 --> 07:17.700
<b>At first, I thought they harvested
what we see in the jars.</b>

07:18.120 --> 07:21.830
<b>I didn't even know
that they're just the seeds.</b>

07:22.330 --> 07:26.920
<b>When you look at things only from
one perspective, you don't see its true shape.</b>

07:27.300 --> 07:29.130
<b>You're free to think whatever.</b>

07:29.380 --> 07:31.470
<b>But isn't it too quick to make assumptions?</b>

07:32.510 --> 07:36.720
<b>Talk it out. Give it a good look.
Try to understand.</b>

07:36.810 --> 07:39.980
<b>Or you'll never figure out
what someone is like.</b>

07:42.310 --> 07:44.480
<b><i>At the least,
I'm looking your way, Sakura.</i></b>

07:44.650 --> 07:47.020
<b><i>So why don't you look this way as well?</i></b>

07:48.780 --> 07:49.940
<b>That guy...</b>

07:50.490 --> 07:52.320
<b>Is he actually good at fighting?</b>

07:52.320 --> 07:54.950
<b>Is that the only thing
that matters to you?</b>

07:56.700 --> 07:58.700
<b>TONPU SHOPPING STREET</b>

08:03.040 --> 08:05.130
<b><i>You're free to think whatever.</i></b>

08:05.130 --> 08:07.130
<b><i>But isn't it too quick to make assumptions?</i></b>

08:07.210 --> 08:10.840
<b><i>You say that, but it's the truth.</i></b>

08:13.590 --> 08:18.100
<b>Hey, mister! Want some bread?
It's freshly baked!</b>

08:18.100 --> 08:19.640
<b>Huh? Why...</b>

08:19.640 --> 08:26.860
<b>Why? You Furin kids always help us out.
I gotta give back at least a little bit!</b>

08:26.860 --> 08:29.860
<b>You're the one who was
in that big scuffle yesterday!</b>

08:29.860 --> 08:33.950
<b>Everyone was talking about
how great it was that you were here.</b>

08:34.410 --> 08:36.280
<b>I-I'm not hungry right now.</b>

08:36.280 --> 08:38.370
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

08:40.540 --> 08:43.540
<b>Then take these, and eat it for lunch!</b>

08:43.540 --> 08:46.080
<b>Our bread is tasty even after a while!</b>

08:48.380 --> 08:50.090
<b>Take care!</b>

08:50.460 --> 08:52.970
<b>Hey, man. Thanks for yesterday.</b>

08:53.130 --> 08:56.090
<b>Hey, kid! You were awesome yesterday!</b>

08:56.260 --> 09:00.510
<b>You're pretty tough!
How about a drinking contest with me?</b>

09:00.510 --> 09:02.310
<b>Don't be stupid, Dad!</b>

09:05.980 --> 09:07.940
<b><i>What the hell is happening?</i></b>

09:08.560 --> 09:11.320
<b><i>More like, what's wrong
with everyone in this town?</i></b>

09:12.230 --> 09:14.900
<b><i>They're way too chummy with a guy like me.</i></b>

09:16.240 --> 09:18.660
<b><i>A guy like me...</i></b>

09:21.120 --> 09:22.870
<b><i>Did I just assume...</i></b>

09:23.500 --> 09:26.120
<b><i>that they'd never look at me like that?</i></b>

09:29.290 --> 09:30.290
<b>Um!</b>

09:31.630 --> 09:34.720
<b>You're from Furin, right?
Please help me!</b>

09:39.930 --> 09:44.640
<b>Man, I was just having fun
chattin' up a chick.</b>

09:45.270 --> 09:47.560
<b>Why'd ya get in my way?</b>

09:47.810 --> 09:49.900
<b>Because that girl totally didn't want to!</b>

09:50.150 --> 09:52.940
<b>What? You're totally makin' stuff up.</b>

09:52.940 --> 09:56.070
<b>You go off about protectin' town,
callin' yourselves Bofurin or whatever.</b>

09:56.570 --> 09:59.620
<b>But you're clearly
someone who needs protecting.</b>

10:00.280 --> 10:01.330
<b>So true!</b>

10:09.670 --> 10:12.210
<b>Hey, you still don't get it?</b>

10:12.210 --> 10:15.130
<b>You'll never be a hero!</b>

10:17.010 --> 10:19.760
<b>Go home and cry on mommy's shoulder!</b>

10:19.930 --> 10:21.260
<b>Yeah, totally!</b>

10:23.600 --> 10:27.270
<b>Listen, kid. I'm about to lose it.</b>

10:27.520 --> 10:29.310
<b>...will be purged.</b>

10:29.310 --> 10:31.150
<b>Huh? What?</b>

10:31.310 --> 10:36.990
<b>Those who cause pain, who bring destruction,
who hold evil in their heart...</b>

10:37.150 --> 10:41.570
<b>will be purged by Bofurin without exception!</b>

10:46.080 --> 10:49.870
<b>The only ones who get stronger by spouting
nonsense are those guys in superhero shows.</b>

10:53.130 --> 10:55.380
<b>Let go already!</b>

10:55.380 --> 10:57.010
<b>You're being a pest!</b>

10:57.010 --> 11:00.130
<b>I don't care if you're a windbreaker
or a windstorm,</b>

11:00.430 --> 11:04.810
<b>but you're the one who's gonna get purged!</b>

11:18.740 --> 11:20.910
<b>Why are you saving me?</b>

11:23.620 --> 11:25.030
<b>What the hell do ya think you're doin'?</b>

11:25.030 --> 11:26.120
<b>You from Furin too?</b>

11:26.120 --> 11:28.790
<b>Your buddy's here to save you all by himself?</b>

11:29.330 --> 11:32.000
<b>Save? Buddy?</b>

11:32.290 --> 11:33.790
<b>Don't get me wrong, moron.</b>

11:34.590 --> 11:38.630
<b>I just hate weaklings
that mistakenly think they're strong.</b>

11:42.090 --> 11:43.590
<b>Makes me sick.</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:46.220
<b>What was that, ya little punk!</b>

11:46.350 --> 11:47.810
<b>You can't take them on your own!</b>

11:56.360 --> 11:59.610
<b>A-Amazing.</b>

12:01.400 --> 12:02.320
<b><i>An instant.</i></b>

12:02.320 --> 12:03.740
<b>The hell? You're seriously weak.</b>

12:03.740 --> 12:05.910
<b><i>In just a blink of an eye...</i></b>

12:06.080 --> 12:07.740
<b><i>Who is this guy?</i></b>

12:13.960 --> 12:16.340
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

12:17.040 --> 12:19.130
<b>You must be disappointed.</b>

12:19.130 --> 12:23.300
<b>That someone like me is in Bofurin,
and attending Furin.</b>

12:23.590 --> 12:26.970
<b>Don't get me wrong.
I didn't save your or anything.</b>

12:27.430 --> 12:29.850
<b>You can find posers all over the place.</b>

12:30.100 --> 12:33.140
<b>I dunno what made you come to Furin.</b>

12:33.140 --> 12:35.400
<b>But at least know
what you're capable of.</b>

12:35.400 --> 12:36.610
<b>I was...</b>

12:38.020 --> 12:42.610
<b>Back in middle school,
I was a gofer every single day.</b>

12:42.610 --> 12:46.660
<b>They punched me.
I couldn't do anything but obey them.</b>

12:47.450 --> 12:49.700
<b>And the guy who saved me...</b>

12:49.910 --> 12:51.950
<b>was someone from Furin.</b>

12:52.830 --> 12:56.210
<b>Someone I'd normally only feel fearful of...</b>

12:57.000 --> 12:58.540
<b>looked awesome.</b>

12:59.800 --> 13:01.760
<b>And I wanted to be like him.</b>

13:02.300 --> 13:06.510
<b>I came to Furin because I wanted
to be strong and awesome.</b>

13:08.050 --> 13:11.770
<b>But I'm so pathetic.</b>

13:17.100 --> 13:21.900
<b><i>Guys like that who are only about style
always chicken out in fights.</i></b>

13:21.980 --> 13:23.570
<b><i>Nothing is lamer than that.</i></b>

13:23.650 --> 13:28.160
<b><i>...will be purged by Bofurin
without exception!</i></b>

13:32.330 --> 13:35.160
<b>You're a weak fighter.
Don't be a crybaby, too.</b>

13:35.160 --> 13:37.080
<b>It's only gonna make you look weaker.</b>

13:38.130 --> 13:42.210
<b>But you're probably not lame, y'know?</b>

13:44.090 --> 13:46.430
<b>Um, are you okay?</b>

13:48.470 --> 13:49.970
<b>Uh, well, I'm totally fine!</b>

13:49.970 --> 13:55.350
<b>SHE'S NOT INTERESTED!!</b>

13:50.390 --> 13:53.470
<b>I wondered what'd happen to me
when he grabbed my arm,</b>

13:53.470 --> 13:55.350
<b>but I'm grateful you were there.</b>

13:56.480 --> 13:58.230
<b>Really. Thank you so much.</b>

14:03.480 --> 14:05.240
<b>And, thanks to you, too.</b>

14:09.030 --> 14:10.200
<b>Sakura...</b>

14:11.120 --> 14:12.280
<b>Sakura-san!</b>

14:14.080 --> 14:15.200
<b>What?</b>

14:15.660 --> 14:17.370
<b>Oh, um...</b>

14:19.080 --> 14:20.710
<b>TOP SECRET</b>

14:21.540 --> 14:25.170
<b>What's your height? Weight? Blood type?
Hobbies? Skills? Favorite type of girls?</b>

14:25.840 --> 14:29.010
<b>You're slightly taller than me
so about 169 cm tall.</b>

14:29.010 --> 14:31.970
<b>- More muscles, less fat, so about 59 kg.
- Hey!</b>

14:32.180 --> 14:35.020
<b>Your shoe size is about 26.5 cm,
so you'll probably grow even taller.</b>

14:35.850 --> 14:37.390
<b>Creep! Don't touch me!
Don't measure me!</b>

14:37.390 --> 14:38.690
<b>S-Sorry.</b>

14:39.100 --> 14:43.730
<b>I like gathering data on guys
who I like and think are cool.</b>

14:44.980 --> 14:45.940
<b>Do whatever.</b>

14:45.940 --> 14:48.700
<b>Okay! I'll watch you up close
and personal!</b>

14:50.530 --> 14:53.280
<b>And while I'm at it,
I can show you around!</b>

14:53.280 --> 14:57.200
<b>Huh? You think I don't know
how to get to school?</b>

14:57.200 --> 14:59.290
<b>Oh, that's not what I mean.</b>

14:59.580 --> 15:01.960
<b>I may not be of any help in a fight,</b>

15:01.960 --> 15:04.550
<b>but if it's about the town
or the folks living here, I'll guide you.</b>

15:06.840 --> 15:08.300
<b>All the way to the top.</b>

15:11.010 --> 15:13.470
<b>Now, school is this way!</b>

15:13.600 --> 15:15.680
<b>Hey, don't touch me! Don't drag me!</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:18.390
<b>Listen to me, damn it!</b>

15:24.110 --> 15:26.780
<b>FURIN HIGH SCHOOL</b>

15:26.780 --> 15:29.110
<b>BOFURIN</b>

15:31.610 --> 15:34.910
<b>I welcome you, first-years.</b>

15:36.660 --> 15:40.250
<b>Come on! Let's get on with it already!</b>

15:40.250 --> 15:42.880
<b>Shut up! I get hungry after a fight!</b>

15:43.460 --> 15:44.540
<b>This bread is tasty!</b>

15:44.540 --> 15:48.880
<b>Oh! Bread from Saboten!
Their bread is so tasty, even when cold!</b>

15:48.880 --> 15:49.720
<b>No, wait.</b>

15:50.050 --> 15:51.930
<b>Let's just go already!</b>

15:52.930 --> 15:55.760
<b>Sakura-san! Hurry, hurry!</b>

15:55.760 --> 15:59.310
<b>If you wanna go that badly,
you can go on ahead by yourself.</b>

16:05.270 --> 16:06.900
<b>BOFURIN</b>

16:06.900 --> 16:08.650
<b><i>So many of 'em...</i></b>

16:09.690 --> 16:11.570
<b>Sakura-san!</b>

16:15.570 --> 16:18.120
<b>This is Bofurin's headquarters!</b>

16:18.120 --> 16:19.450
<b>I'm so pumped up!</b>

16:20.120 --> 16:23.790
<b><i>So there's a bunch of people
like those guys here.</i></b>

16:25.080 --> 16:27.210
<b>Sakura-san! I found it!</b>

16:27.710 --> 16:29.050
<b>Found what?</b>

16:29.380 --> 16:31.300
<b>The class rosters!</b>

16:31.630 --> 16:33.180
<b>What's with this sign?</b>

16:33.180 --> 16:36.640
<b>Let's see, um... Oh!</b>

16:36.640 --> 16:42.640
<b>AKIHIKO NIREI
HARUKA SAKURA</b>

16:37.050 --> 16:40.980
<b>Yay! Sakura-san,
we're in the same class!</b>

16:40.980 --> 16:42.640
<b>All right, all right.</b>

16:43.140 --> 16:45.150
<b>I wonder who else is with us.</b>

16:45.150 --> 16:49.190
<b>Wait, Suo-san? Kiryu-san, too!
And even Tsugeura-san!</b>

16:49.610 --> 16:50.900
<b>You know them?</b>

16:50.900 --> 16:54.610
<b>Nope! Not at all!
But they're all amazing people!</b>

16:54.610 --> 16:56.660
<b>- We'll start with Suo-san.
- No, that's okay!</b>

16:56.910 --> 16:59.290
<b>Don't get so worked up
over how they split up the students.</b>

16:59.290 --> 17:01.080
<b>It's the same no matter who you're with.</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:03.330
<b>Wh-What are you saying, Sakura-san?</b>

17:03.540 --> 17:06.830
<b>Who you're gonna be with
is totally important...</b>

17:08.290 --> 17:09.960
<b>Huh? What is it?</b>

17:10.170 --> 17:11.710
<b>Wait, no way.</b>

17:11.960 --> 17:14.800
<b>- Seriously?
- Hey? What is it?</b>

17:15.090 --> 17:19.680
<b>Of all people...
To be in the same class with...</b>

17:19.890 --> 17:22.390
<b>What happened to all that hype?</b>

17:23.060 --> 17:24.560
<b>You wanna go home, after—</b>

17:24.560 --> 17:28.900
<b>Sakura-san,
can you promise me one thing?</b>

17:29.150 --> 17:30.110
<b>Promise?</b>

17:30.520 --> 17:34.200
<b>Please be friendly to everyone in class.</b>

17:34.320 --> 17:36.570
<b>Ya gotta smile. Smile!</b>

17:36.860 --> 17:38.570
<b>Huh? Are you joking?</b>

17:38.570 --> 17:39.990
<b>I-I'm serious!</b>

17:40.660 --> 17:41.830
<b>Listen up.</b>

17:41.830 --> 17:45.580
<b>The members of Bofurin gathered
together to protect this town.</b>

17:45.580 --> 17:50.790
<b>FURIN</b>

17:46.290 --> 17:49.790
<b>And because you're originally
from out of town,</b>

17:49.790 --> 17:53.090
<b>it'll be no surprise if people think ill of that
and ask why you came here.</b>

17:53.710 --> 18:00.430
<b>I think it's important to get people to understand
that you're harmless, and not Bofurin's enemy.</b>

18:00.430 --> 18:02.010
<b>So at all costs...</b>

18:03.930 --> 18:05.020
<b>What are you doing?</b>

18:05.020 --> 18:06.310
<b>Warming up.</b>

18:06.310 --> 18:07.390
<b>Why?</b>

18:07.690 --> 18:12.110
<b>I don't know what kinda guys are in there,
so I gotta get ready for anything.</b>

18:12.110 --> 18:14.400
<b>Were you listening to anything I just said?</b>

18:14.740 --> 18:16.700
<b>Sakura-san, you're an outsider!</b>

18:16.700 --> 18:18.740
<b>From a simple misunderstanding,
this class...</b>

18:18.740 --> 18:23.870
<b>No, the entire school may turn against you!
What would happen if it did!?</b>

18:26.160 --> 18:29.580
<b>I don't care. Why would it matter
if they turn against me?</b>

18:32.380 --> 18:36.010
<b>I came here to fight my way up
to the top spot, you know?</b>

18:43.720 --> 18:45.350
<b><i>Man, they're totally staring!</i></b>

18:45.350 --> 18:47.480
<b><i>Ow, ow, ow!
Their glances are like daggers!</i></b>

18:53.520 --> 18:55.610
<b>Not bad, I guess.</b>

18:55.610 --> 18:56.610
<b>Hey.</b>

18:58.110 --> 18:59.910
<b>You must be Sakura-kun.</b>

19:01.120 --> 19:03.870
<b>What if I am?
Who the hell are you?</b>

19:03.870 --> 19:05.580
<b>Oh, wait, don’t!</b>

19:05.580 --> 19:08.160
<b>I'm sorry, he gets easily excited.</b>

19:08.160 --> 19:09.670
<b>Anyway, you must be...</b>

19:10.250 --> 19:12.670
<b>That eyepatch and the long tassel earring...</b>

19:13.920 --> 19:14.670
<b>There's no doubt about it!</b>

19:15.500 --> 19:17.420
<b>I'm Leonardo DiCaprio.</b>

19:18.970 --> 19:22.720
<b>You're from overseas?
I am... um...</b>

19:22.720 --> 19:23.640
<b>Seriously?</b>

19:23.640 --> 19:25.180
<b>Nope. I'm Japanese.</b>

19:26.060 --> 19:28.430
<b><i>I didn't know he was such a joker.</i></b>

19:28.430 --> 19:31.150
<b><i>I thought he'd be more aloof,
or cold-hearted, even.</i></b>

19:31.230 --> 19:32.020
<b>Um...</b>

19:32.770 --> 19:34.900
<b>You must be Suo-san?</b>

19:35.270 --> 19:38.440
<b>Yup. Everyone calls me that.</b>

19:38.900 --> 19:43.870
<b>By the way, this eyepatch seals away
an ancient Chinese spirit into my right eye.</b>

19:44.200 --> 19:46.240
<b>Wasn't it from a past accident?</b>

19:46.240 --> 19:48.790
<b>Yup. That's what everyone says.</b>

19:48.790 --> 19:51.250
<b>The hell? So he's all talk.</b>

19:51.250 --> 19:54.960
<b>No, but among the first-years,
he's quite...</b>

19:55.920 --> 19:58.510
<b>That's enough about me.</b>

19:58.670 --> 20:01.880
<b>Now about you, Sakura-kun.</b>

20:02.840 --> 20:04.090
<b><i>Oh, this isn't good.</i></b>

20:04.600 --> 20:06.350
<b><i>So folks from outside of town...</i></b>

20:06.640 --> 20:08.100
<b><i>are treated as anomalies after all?</i></b>

20:09.890 --> 20:11.890
<b><i>It might not be possible to stop this.</i></b>

20:12.730 --> 20:15.020
<b>I heard all about it! That was amazing!</b>

20:15.020 --> 20:17.940
<b>You were the star of the main street brawl
yesterday, right?</b>

20:18.110 --> 20:19.990
<b>Yesterday? Main street?</b>

20:19.990 --> 20:23.070
<b>What do you mean, Suo?
Who the hell is that?</b>

20:23.530 --> 20:28.160
<b>You know about the clash with spaltips
on main street yesterday, right?</b>

20:28.450 --> 20:30.250
<b>Hiragi-san and a few others headed out.</b>

20:30.250 --> 20:33.420
<b>But the one who was at the scene before them,
and was protecting the town was...</b>

20:34.500 --> 20:36.290
<b>Sakura-kun!</b>

20:36.380 --> 20:38.920
<b>I-Is that so, Sakura-san?</b>

20:39.170 --> 20:40.050
<b>Oh?</b>

20:40.050 --> 20:41.010
<b>For real?</b>

20:41.010 --> 20:46.050
<b>I heard Hiragi-san went, so I stopped worrying
and totally tuned out.</b>

20:46.050 --> 20:47.100
<b>Ditto.</b>

20:47.100 --> 20:49.220
<b>My grandma said she was there.</b>

20:49.220 --> 20:52.730
<b>Said someone she didn't recognize
was in a Furin uniform.</b>

20:52.730 --> 20:55.270
<b>I knew someone
was coming from outta town.</b>

20:55.270 --> 20:57.440
<b>But that's damn good,
considering classes haven't started!</b>

20:58.900 --> 21:00.280
<b>S-So close...</b>

21:01.070 --> 21:02.740
<b><i>F-For now, this is good.</i></b>

21:02.740 --> 21:04.280
<b>Sakura-san, nice one!</b>

21:04.490 --> 21:08.990
<b><i>Seems they won't mistakenly see Sakura-san
as an enemy of Bofurin.</i></b>

21:09.240 --> 21:11.000
<b><i>So I'm sure he will, too.</i></b>

21:11.540 --> 21:15.540
<b>But why did you come
to a place like this from outta town?</b>

21:16.380 --> 21:18.460
<b>I came here for the top spot.</b>

21:26.180 --> 21:27.930
<b>You've got it all wrong!</b>

21:27.930 --> 21:32.890
<b>It's not like he wants to
hold you down or beat you up.</b>

21:33.060 --> 21:33.980
<b>But I do.</b>

21:33.980 --> 21:35.020
<b>You stay quiet!</b>

21:51.540 --> 21:54.330
<b>Sakura-san! You can't fight with him.</b>

21:54.460 --> 21:58.750
<b>There's no doubt he's the most dangerous guy
in our class, no, our school!</b>

21:59.130 --> 22:01.380
<b>That's Kyotaro Sugishita.</b>

22:01.670 --> 22:03.760
<b>- Sugishita.
- Hey.</b>

22:03.840 --> 22:06.930
<b>I like mad dogs, you know?</b>

22:10.930 --> 22:11.850
<b>I'll crush you!</b>

22:17.690 --> 22:20.560
<b>Whew. You almost got caught up in that.</b>

22:22.070 --> 22:23.280
<b>Not bad.</b>

22:24.070 --> 22:26.530
<b>This is what I'd expect
from Furin High.</b>

22:28.740 --> 22:30.530
<b>That's more like it.</b>

22:31.030 --> 22:34.040
<b>THE HERO OF MY DREAMS</b>

23:25.590 --> 23:27.840
<b>Sakura-san, you shouldn't do that.</b>

23:27.840 --> 23:29.510
<b>What's this all of a sudden?</b>

23:29.510 --> 23:32.180
<b>The food that you received from everyone
at the shopping street.</b>

23:32.180 --> 23:34.470
<b>You threw them out before the fight.</b>

23:34.470 --> 23:38.810
<b>I threw it aside in the spur of the moment
trying to save your butt.</b>

23:38.810 --> 23:41.650
<b>This is this, and that is that.</b>

23:43.520 --> 23:48.610
<b>Besides, I picked them all up
and ate 'em afterwards.</b>

23:50.530 --> 23:53.410
<b>You're surprisingly sincere,
Sakura-san.</b>
